# ---------- Day 1 ka purana nested git repo ----------
# `apps/web/` mein pehle apna alag `.git` tha (Day 1 scaffold ki 3 commits).
# Usse wahan chhod dete to git `apps/web` ko **gitlink** (embedded repo) maan
# leta aur poora frontend untracked reh jaata — clone karne pe apps/web khaali
# milta, bina koi error diye. Isliye woh dir rename kar diya hai; history
# safe hai, delete nahi hui.
#
# Wapas chahiye ho to:  mv apps/web/.git.day1-backup apps/web/.git
apps/web/.git.day1-backup/

# Local hosting integration metadata. The shareable project configuration is
# stored in apps/web/.axiom/.
apps/web/.openai/

